ind the price per cup, we multiply by $8:$\n\n$$\n1.60\\times 8=12.80\n$$\n\nTherefore, the chemical solution costs $\\$12.80$ per cup." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-44ddfc6b-4838-5599-a86f-bf8221237272"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-44ddfc6b-4838-5599-a86f-bf8221237272" :answer-field/id #uuid "44ddfc6b-4838-5599-a86f-bf8221237272" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-3497fac9-fc4e-56a7-bdbf-3df6bb29d82a" :answer-field/choices ["answer-5b0c9344-df9c-5f3f-b871-4631ff371574" "answer-3497fac9-fc4e-56a7-bdbf-3df6bb29d82a" "answer-d62a7cd4-5580-5f49-81c7-8e925474945a" "answer-2be12b11-3652-52e4-adce-89e1e7625e58" "answer-2ed0b6cc-dc15-5ab5-8bc7-84da3585b4ac"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-5b0c9344-df9c-5f3f-b871-4631ff371574" :answer/id #uuid "5b0c9344-df9c-5f3f-b871-4631ff371574" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$10.20$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-3497fac9-fc4e-56a7-bdbf-3df6bb29d82a" :answer/id #uuid "3497fac9-fc4e-56a7-bdbf-3df6bb29d82a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$12.80$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-d62a7cd4-5580-5f49-81c7-8e925474945a" :answer/id #uuid "d62a7cd4-5580-5f49-81c7-8e925474945a" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$14.40$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2be12b11-3652-52e4-adce-89e1e7625e58" :answer/id #uuid "2be12b11-3652-52e4-adce-89e1e7625e58" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$8.00$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-2ed0b6cc-dc15-5ab5-8bc7-84da3585b4ac" :answer/id #uuid "2ed0b6cc-dc15-5ab5-8bc7-84da3585b4ac" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$9.60$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "question-4b574a7a-bdad-59b8-aadb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/id #uuid "4b574a7a-bdad-59b8-aadb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/math-academy-id "q-354928" :question/problem "Emily filled a container with $48$ fluid ounces of juice and paid $\\$11.52$ for it. What's the unit price per cup?\n\nAssume that there are $8$ fluid ounces in one cup." :question/worked-solution "First, we convert from fluid ounces to cups. There are $8$ fluid ounces in each cup, so we divide the number of fluid ounces by $8:$     \n\n$$\n48÷8=6\n$$\n\nSo, $48$ fluid ounces is the same as $6$ cups. Now, to find the unit price per cup, we divide the total price by $6:$ \n\n$$\n11.52÷6=1.92\n$$\n\nTherefore, the juice costs $\\$1.92$ per cup." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate :question/answer-fields ["answer-field-ffbd78f3-a124-58f1-9f81-8177785c5280"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id "answer-field-ffbd78f3-a124-58f1-9f81-8177785c5280" :answer-field/id #uuid "ffbd78f3-a124-58f1-9f81-8177785c5280" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer-field/choices ["answer-09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" "answer-747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" "answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" "answer-42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985" "answer-1e0f4944-55fa-5715-8483-aaea1dc8f44d"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "answer-09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" :answer/id #uuid "09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$0.24$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" :answer/id #uuid "747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$1.75$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer/id #uuid "210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$\\$1.92$ per cup" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "answer-42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985" :answer/