 the unit price per cup?\n\nAssume that there are $16$ cups in one gallon."] ["question-47942259-bbea-5bc3-9f75-4c601ace6485" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that there are $16$ cups in each gallon. So, to find the unit price per cup, we divide the total price by $16:$  \n\n$$\n28.80÷16=1.80\n$$\n\nTherefore, the olive oil costs $\\$1.80$ per cup."] ["question-47942259-bbea-5bc3-9f75-4c601ace6485" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/id #uuid "aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25"] ["answer-5d4845e4-612a-5054-aeae-a3540b5335ce" :answer/id #uuid "5d4845e4-612a-5054-aeae-a3540b5335ce"] ["answer-5d4845e4-612a-5054-aeae-a3540b5335ce" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-5d4845e4-612a-5054-aeae-a3540b5335ce" :answer/value "$\\$1.35$ per cup"] ["answer-886edd60-698b-549f-8196-b72a0e84b25f" :answer/id #uuid "886edd60-698b-549f-8196-b72a0e84b25f"] ["answer-886edd60-698b-549f-8196-b72a0e84b25f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-886edd60-698b-549f-8196-b72a0e84b25f" :answer/value "$\\$1.55$ per cup"] ["answer-0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0" :answer/id #uuid "0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0"] ["answer-0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0" :answer/value "$\\$1.80$ per cup"] ["answer-a9cbb591-e519-5c2b-b76f-4ff684876197" :answer/id #uuid "a9cbb591-e519-5c2b-b76f-4ff684876197"] ["answer-a9cbb591-e519-5c2b-b76f-4ff684876197" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-a9cbb591-e519-5c2b-b76f-4ff684876197" :answer/value "$\\$2.45$ per cup"] ["answer-bc3ec7e6-33e7-50c7-ae5f-0525c9fd2823" :answer/id #uuid "bc3ec7e6-33e7-50c7-ae5f-0525c9fd2823"] ["answer-bc3ec7e6-33e7-50c7-ae5f-0525c9fd2823" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-bc3ec7e6-33e7-50c7-ae5f-0525c9fd2823" :answer/value "$\\$2.65$ per cup"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/key "selection"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/correct "answer-0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/choices "answer-5d4845e4-612a-5054-aeae-a3540b5335ce"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/choices "answer-886edd60-698b-549f-8196-b72a0e84b25f"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/choices "answer-0bb498a5-c5ce-58d6-b875-93f7391859c0"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/choices "answer-a9cbb591-e519-5c2b-b76f-4ff684876197"] ["answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25" :answer-field/choices "answer-bc3ec7e6-33e7-50c7-ae5f-0525c9fd2823"] ["question-47942259-bbea-5bc3-9f75-4c601ace6485" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-aabef55a-2b11-5cea-b9ce-3c10b86a6e25"] [17592186495045 :knowledge-point/questions "question-47942259-bbea-5bc3-9f75-4c601ace6485"] ["question-947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2" :question/id #uuid "947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2"] ["question-947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2" :question/math-academy-id "q-354916"] ["question-947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2" :question/problem "Emily bought $1$ foot of gold wire and paid $\\$5.60$ for it. What's the unit price per yard?\n\nAssume that there are $3$ feet in one yard."] ["question-947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2" :question/worked-solution "First, notice that there are $3$ feet in each yard.  \n\nSince the price is $\\$5.60$ per foot, to find the price per yard, we multiply by $3:$\n\n$$\n5.60\\times 3=16.80\n$$\n\nTherefore, the gold wire costs $\\$16.80$ per yard."] ["question-947d34a3-027e-5d38-b8d1-e6f3a1b0d3d2" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy] ["answer-field-cc1a6bc1-e6b7-5531-84ae-b676cb38f400" :answer-field/id #uuid "cc1a6bc1-e6b7-5531-84ae-b676cb38f400"] ["answer-7abd7d8f-b5de-5cfc-b3bf-1a23c149a