adb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/math-academy-id "q-354928"] ["question-4b574a7a-bdad-59b8-aadb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/problem "Emily filled a container with $48$ fluid ounces of juice and paid $\\$11.52$ for it. What's the unit price per cup?\n\nAssume that there are $8$ fluid ounces in one cup."] ["question-4b574a7a-bdad-59b8-aadb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/worked-solution "First, we convert from fluid ounces to cups. There are $8$ fluid ounces in each cup, so we divide the number of fluid ounces by $8:$     \n\n$$\n48÷8=6\n$$\n\nSo, $48$ fluid ounces is the same as $6$ cups. Now, to find the unit price per cup, we divide the total price by $6:$ \n\n$$\n11.52÷6=1.92\n$$\n\nTherefore, the juice costs $\\$1.92$ per cup."] ["question-4b574a7a-bdad-59b8-aadb-22d876ef5c0b" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-ffbd78f3-a124-58f1-9f81-8177785c5280" :answer-field/id #uuid "ffbd78f3-a124-58f1-9f81-8177785c5280"] ["answer-09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" :answer/id #uuid "09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f"] ["answer-09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-09f9eee1-0098-5229-b9ce-e4b65237d12f" :answer/value "$\\$0.24$ per cup"] ["answer-747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" :answer/id #uuid "747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057"] ["answer-747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-747d7d4b-1fd2-5d3e-86b4-da9429862057" :answer/value "$\\$1.75$ per cup"] ["answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer/id #uuid "210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7"] ["answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-210351d0-1105-53ce-b4c8-02147d3c6fd7" :answer/value "$\\$1.92$ per cup"] ["answer-42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985" :answer/id #uuid "42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985"] ["answer-42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985" :answer/type :answer.type/text] ["answer-42e3a724-292a-58b1-ac69-9a6cb1767985" :answer/value "$\\$2.10$ per cup"